  "details": "Hello Everyone\n\nThis is an updated idea from the precedent \"Object: Camera\" but this time is a Videocamera Object we can select to summon, and take a gif or a video through the game, we can do the same, either share or send to someone in your friend list.\nThis could make an easy way to share clips in other apps, social media and more.\n\n\nHope this works too, it could change the way we see inside the vr chatting experience.\n\nGrimReaperx",
